{"id":"n24781-1-9","stage":2,"title":"자세하다 · 仔细","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24781-1-9-1","ko":"그 일이 어떻게 되었다고요?","zh":"那件事最后怎么样了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"되었다고요?","meaning":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","explanation":"되다：发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되었다고요","audio":"/audio/4d558a9d27a38b0b4411.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"发展到某种情况（询问结果或状况）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/37c5995a91082ed7873a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24781-1-9-2","ko":"자세한 내용은 만나서 말씀드릴게요.","zh":"详细情况我们见面时再告诉您。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자세한","meaning":"仔细，详细","explanation":"자세하다：仔细，详细；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"자세하다","audio":"/audio/b28cd4924b1e0327056c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24781","senseId":"1","lemma":"자세하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자세한","audio":"/audio/7533c2cb1b9256c28cab.mp3"}},{"text":"내용은","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용：内容；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"내용","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72573","senseId":"2","lemma":"내용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내용은","audio":"/audio/589f8421d14d27db4f86.mp3"}},{"text":"만나서","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나서","audio":"/audio/642da571c6fc80e0d142.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀드릴게요.","meaning":"话；向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知","explanation":"말씀：话；드리다：向尊敬的人表达问候、请求、感谢或告知；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"},{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"2","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"2","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀드릴게요","audio":"/audio/dcaaafd615595ca0aa34.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b28cd4924b1e0327","term":"자세하다","zh":"仔细，详细","audio":"/audio/b28cd4924b1e0327056c.mp3","e